BT /F2 16 Tf 54 723 Td (Code of Conduct \(2025\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 701 Td (Document code: POL-CORP-001. Owner: Legal and Compliance \(General Counsel, Hannah Brightwell\),) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 688 Td (cost centre CC-5200. Approved by: the Board of Meridian Instruments Ltd. Effective date: 15) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 675 Td (January 2025. Edition: 2025, version 4 \(replaces the 2022 edition\).) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 650 Td (1. Purpose and Scope) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 628 Td (1.1 This Code of Conduct sets out the standards of behaviour that Meridian Instruments Ltd) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 615 Td (expects from everyone who works for or on behalf of the company. It describes how our values) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 602 Td (apply in practice and where to find more detailed policies.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 580 Td (1.2 The Code applies to all directors, officers and employees of Meridian Instruments Ltd and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 567 Td (its subsidiaries in the United Kingdom, the Netherlands, the United States and Malaysia,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 554 Td (whatever their grade or location. It also applies to agency workers, contractors and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 541 Td (consultants while they are working for us, and we expect our suppliers, distributors and agents) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 528 Td (to meet equivalent standards.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 506 Td (1.3 The Code cannot cover every situation. Where it does not give a clear answer, ask yourself) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 493 Td (whether the action is legal, whether it is consistent with our values, whether you would be) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 480 Td (comfortable if it were reported in the press, and whether it would be acceptable to your) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 467 Td (manager and your colleagues. If you are still unsure, ask your manager or contact) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 454 Td (compliance@meridian-instruments.example.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 432 Td (1.4 Where local law sets a stricter standard than this Code, the stricter standard applies.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 419 Td (Where this Code sets a stricter standard than local law, the Code applies.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 397 Td (1.5 Breaches of the Code may lead to disciplinary action up to and including dismissal, in line) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 384 Td (with the Disciplinary and Grievance Procedure \(POL-HR-040\), and may also be breaches of law.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 359 Td (2. Our Values) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 337 Td (2.1 Meridian has four values: Precision, Integrity, Care and Ownership. They were chosen by) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 324 Td (employees at all four of our sites, and they describe the company we want to be.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 302 Td (2.2 Precision. We make measuring instruments that people rely on to stay safe. We take the same) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 289 Td (care over our records, our reports and our promises. We do not guess where we should check, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 276 Td (we do not round figures to make them look better.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 254 Td (2.3 Integrity. We are honest with customers, colleagues, regulators and shareholders. We) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 241 Td (compete on the merits of our products and never through improper payments or misleading claims.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 219 Td (2.4 Care. We look after the health, safety and wellbeing of our colleagues, the people who use) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 206 Td (our products, and the communities around our sites. We treat people with respect.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 184 Td (2.5 Ownership. We take responsibility for our actions and their consequences. When we make a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 171 Td (mistake, we say so and fix it. When we see a problem, we raise it.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 149 Td (2.6 Managers have additional responsibilities. They must lead by example, make sure their teams) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 136 Td (understand the Code, create an environment in which people feel able to raise concerns, and act) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 123 Td (promptly when concerns are raised with them.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 98 Td (3. Speaking Up) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 76 Td (3.1 If you see or suspect something that breaches this Code, the law or our policies, you are) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 63 Td (expected to speak up. Early reporting allows us to deal with problems before they cause harm.) Tj ET
endstream
endobj
