BT /F1 10 Tf 54 729 Td (3.2 You can raise a concern with your manager, a more senior manager, People Help, Legal and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 716 Td (Compliance, or through the confidential channels described in the Speak Up Policy) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 703 Td (\(POL-CORP-004\), which allow anonymous reporting where local law permits.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 681 Td (3.3 Meridian does not tolerate retaliation against anyone who raises a concern in good faith or) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 668 Td (who takes part in an investigation, even if the concern turns out to be unfounded. Retaliation) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 655 Td (is itself a serious breach of this Code.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 633 Td (3.4 Concerns will be handled confidentially and investigated fairly. Deliberately false reports) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 620 Td (made to cause harm are a disciplinary matter.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 595 Td (4. Respect at Work) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 573 Td (4.1 Everyone at Meridian has the right to be treated with dignity and respect. We do not) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 560 Td (tolerate harassment, bullying, discrimination or victimisation in any form, whether in person,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 547 Td (in writing, online or at work-related social events.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 525 Td (4.2 Harassment includes unwanted conduct related to a protected characteristic that violates a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 512 Td (person's dignity or creates an intimidating, hostile, degrading, humiliating or offensive) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 499 Td (environment. Sexual harassment includes unwanted conduct of a sexual nature. Meridian takes) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 486 Td (reasonable steps to prevent sexual harassment, including training for all managers.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 464 Td (4.3 Decisions about recruitment, pay, promotion, development and dismissal must be based on) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 451 Td (merit and objective criteria. The Recruitment and Selection Manual \(POL-HR-052\) sets out how we) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 438 Td (make fair hiring decisions.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 416 Td (4.4 We respect the human rights of our employees and of workers in our supply chain. We do not) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 403 Td (use forced, bonded or child labour, and we expect the same of our suppliers. Our annual Modern) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 390 Td (Slavery and Human Trafficking Statement describes the steps we take.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 368 Td (4.5 We respect the right of employees to join, or not to join, a trade union or works council,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 355 Td (and to take part in collective bargaining where local law provides for it. In the Netherlands) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 342 Td (we consult the works council \(ondernemingsraad\) on matters where it has statutory rights.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 317 Td (5. Health, Safety and Environment) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 295 Td (5.1 Our products protect workers in hazardous environments, and we apply the same seriousness) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 282 Td (to safety at our own sites. Every employee must follow safety rules, use the protective) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 269 Td (equipment provided and report hazards, accidents and near misses. The Employee Handbook) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 256 Td (\(HBK-HR-001\) explains site-specific requirements.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 234 Td (5.2 You have the right to stop any work that you believe is unsafe, and you will not be) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 221 Td (penalised for doing so in good faith.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 199 Td (5.3 We aim to reduce the environmental impact of our operations and products, including energy) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 186 Td (use at our manufacturing sites in Leeds and Penang, packaging waste and the recovery of) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 173 Td (end-of-life instruments. Our battery take-back and calibration gas cylinder return schemes must) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 160 Td (be followed.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 138 Td (5.4 Product safety is fundamental. Never ship, release or certify a product that you know or) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 125 Td (suspect does not meet its specification or the relevant safety standard. Report product quality) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 112 Td (concerns to Quality Assurance immediately.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 87 Td (6. Conflicts of Interest) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 65 Td (6.1 A conflict of interest arises when your personal interests, or those of a close family) Tj ET
endstream
