BT /F2 13 Tf 54 360 Td (7. Anti-Bribery and Corruption) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 338 Td (7.1 Meridian has zero tolerance for bribery and corruption. We comply with the UK Bribery Act) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 325 Td (2010, the US Foreign Corrupt Practices Act, the Dutch Criminal Code, the Malaysian) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 312 Td (Anti-Corruption Commission Act 2009 and all other applicable anti-corruption laws.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 290 Td (7.2 You must never offer, promise, give, request or accept a bribe, directly or through a third) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 277 Td (party. A bribe is anything of value given or received to improperly influence a decision or to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 264 Td (obtain or keep business or an advantage. It does not have to be cash; it can include gifts,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 251 Td (hospitality, travel, jobs or internships for relatives, donations or discounts.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 229 Td (7.3 Public officials require special care. Public officials include employees of government) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 216 Td (agencies, regulators, customs and port authorities, state-owned enterprises, and public) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 203 Td (utilities. Many of our customers in the water and energy sectors are state-owned, so their) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 190 Td (employees count as public officials.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 168 Td (7.4 We are responsible for the actions of third parties acting on our behalf, including sales) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 155 Td (agents, distributors, freight forwarders and customs brokers. All such third parties must be) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 142 Td (approved through the third-party due diligence process run by Legal and Compliance before they) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 129 Td (are appointed, and their contracts must include anti-bribery clauses. Commissions must be) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 116 Td (reasonable, paid only against documented services, and paid into an account in the third) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 103 Td (party's own name in the country where the services are performed.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 81 Td (7.5 Facilitation payments, meaning small unofficial payments to speed up a routine government) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 68 Td (action such as clearing goods through customs or issuing a visa, are prohibited everywhere,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 55 Td (even where they are common practice or technically permitted by local law. The only exception) Tj ET
