BT /F1 10 Tf 54 729 Td (is where a payment is demanded under duress, meaning that you reasonably believe your personal) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 716 Td (safety or liberty is at immediate risk. In that case, make the payment, keep yourself safe, and) Tj ET
