BT /F1 10 Tf 54 690 Td (followed up. Duress payments will never be treated as a disciplinary matter.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 668 Td (7.6 Red flags that must be reported include requests for payment in cash or to an offshore) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 655 Td (account, unusually high commissions, a third party recommended by a public official, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 642 Td (reluctance to agree to anti-bribery terms.) Tj ET
