BT /F1 10 Tf 54 607 Td (accurately and in enough detail to show their true purpose. Never create false or misleading) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 594 Td (entries in Atlas or elsewhere.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 569 Td (8. Competition and Fair Dealing) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 547 Td (8.1 We compete vigorously and fairly. Competition laws in the UK, the EU, the United States and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 534 Td (Malaysia prohibit agreements between competitors that restrict competition, such as fixing) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 521 Td (prices, sharing markets or customers, or rigging bids.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 499 Td (8.2 Do not discuss prices, margins, bids, capacity or customer plans with competitors,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 486 Td (including at trade association meetings and industry events. If such a discussion starts,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 473 Td (object, leave the meeting and report it to Legal and Compliance.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 451 Td (8.3 Do not agree with distributors the prices at which they resell our products, and do not) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 438 Td (restrict their ability to sell online, without advice from Legal and Compliance.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 416 Td (8.4 Gather information about competitors only from legitimate public sources. Never use) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 403 Td (confidential information belonging to a competitor, even if it has been offered to you, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 390 Td (never ask a new employee to share confidential information from a former employer.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 368 Td (8.5 Make only accurate, verifiable claims about our products and those of competitors.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 355 Td (Performance claims for Halcyon, Tessera and Lumen products must be supported by test data held) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 342 Td (by the relevant engineering team.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 320 Td (8.6 Trade association membership must be approved by the relevant ExCo member. Before attending) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 307 Td (a trade association meeting, check that there is a written agenda and that minutes will be) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 294 Td (taken, and keep your own notes of what was discussed. Informal gatherings of competitors before) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 281 Td (or after such meetings carry particular risk.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 259 Td (8.7 Competition law also applies to how we deal with customers and suppliers. Exclusive supply) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 246 Td (arrangements, loyalty rebates and long-term purchase commitments may be unlawful for a company) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 233 Td (with a strong position in a particular market. Seek advice from Legal and Compliance before) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 220 Td (agreeing any of these.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 195 Td (9. Gifts and Hospitality) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 173 Td (9.1 Modest gifts and hospitality can help build good business relationships, but they must) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 160 Td (never influence, or appear to influence, a business decision. This section applies to gifts and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 147 Td (hospitality you give on Meridian's behalf and to those you receive because of your work for) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 134 Td (Meridian. It should be read together with section 7.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 112 Td (9.2 Gifts and hospitality must always be:) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 90 Td (- reasonable and proportionate in value and frequency;) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 77 Td (- given or received openly, not in secret;) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 64 Td (- not in cash or cash equivalents such as vouchers or gift cards;) Tj ET
