BT /F2 13 Tf 54 230 Td (10. Trade Compliance and Export Controls) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 208 Td (10.1 Many of our products and technologies are subject to export control and sanctions laws in) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 195 Td (the UK, the EU, the United States and Malaysia. Breaching these laws can result in heavy fines,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 182 Td (loss of export privileges and imprisonment of individuals.) Tj ET
