BT /F1 10 Tf 54 108 Td (embargoed destinations and screens every customer, consignee and end-user against) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 95 Td (restricted-party lists. You must never override or work around an Atlas trade compliance block.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 82 Td (Questions about classification, licensing or screening results should be sent to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 69 Td (tradecompliance@meridian-instruments.example.) Tj ET
