BT /F1 10 Tf 54 585 Td (10.6 Customs declarations must be accurate and complete. Declared values, tariff codes and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 572 Td (countries of origin must be supported by records.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 547 Td (11. Protecting Information and Assets) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 525 Td (11.1 Personal data. We respect the privacy of our colleagues, candidates, customers and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 512 Td (suppliers. Personal data must be handled in line with the Data Protection Policy) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 499 Td (\(POL-CORP-006\). Suspected personal data breaches must be reported immediately through Beacon.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 477 Td (11.2 Confidential information. Information about our products, designs, pricing, customers,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 464 Td (suppliers and finances is valuable. Share it only with people who need it for their work, and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 451 Td (only with third parties who have signed a confidentiality agreement. Your obligation of) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 438 Td (confidentiality continues after your employment ends.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 416 Td (11.3 Information security. Follow the IT security rules set by the IT Security team under) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 403 Td (Mei-Ling Tan, including rules on passwords, multi-factor authentication, removable media and) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 390 Td (use of approved software. Report suspected phishing and security incidents through Beacon) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 377 Td (without delay.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 355 Td (11.4 Intellectual property. Inventions, designs, software and documents you create in the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 342 Td (course of your employment belong to Meridian. Do not use third-party software, images, datasets) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 329 Td (or open-source code in our products without following the engineering approval process.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 307 Td (11.5 Company assets. Use Meridian's equipment, vehicles, funds and systems responsibly and for) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 294 Td (legitimate business purposes. Limited personal use of IT equipment is permitted where it does) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 281 Td (not interfere with your work or breach IT policy.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 259 Td (11.6 Accurate records. Financial records, test reports, calibration certificates, timesheets) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 246 Td (and expense claims must be complete, accurate and honest. Falsifying a record, including a) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 233 Td (calibration certificate or a Halcyon bump test log, is a serious breach of this Code.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 211 Td (11.7 Insider information. If you become aware of confidential information that could affect the) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 198 Td (share price of a listed customer, supplier or partner, you must not deal in their shares or) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 185 Td (pass the information on to anyone else.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 163 Td (11.8 Records must be kept for the periods set out in the Records Retention Schedule) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 150 Td (\(POL-CORP-008\) and must not be destroyed while they are subject to a legal hold issued by Legal) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 137 Td (and Compliance.) Tj ET
BT /F2 13 Tf 54 112 Td (12. Accountability, Training and Administration) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 90 Td (12.1 Responsibility for the Code. The Board has approved this Code and the Audit Committee) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 77 Td (oversees its implementation. The General Counsel is responsible for keeping the Code up to) Tj ET
BT /F1 10 Tf 54 64 Td (date, for interpreting it and for reporting to the Audit Committee on compliance.) Tj ET
